(6913868, 1042655, 108069, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=28742" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Art Roflmao</a>? I hope. I say Art because he is/you are in the process of landing a food photography gig and this is a sneaky entry of a great food shot in a challenge that''s mostly looking for a communal meal of sorts. I say "I hope" because this is some high-level professional food photography and I hope he/you gets/get the gig.<br/> <br/>Either way, this is an excellent photo of food. Great lighting and use of background.</td>', ' Art Roflmao? I hope. I say Art because he is/you are in the process of landing a food photography gig and this is a sneaky entry of a great food shot in a challenge that''s mostly looking for a communal meal of sorts. I say "I hope" because this is some high-level professional food photography and I hope he/you gets/get the gig. Either way, this is an excellent photo of food. Great lighting and use of background.', '2012-11-27 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
