(6915046, 1042657, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice overall setup. I think three things could help improve this, in my eyes:<br/>* Brighter, it''s very dark now<br/>* Tighter crop, the things on the wall are distracting<br/>* Different focus, my eyes want to focus on the stuff near to me, not the chair.</td>', 'Nice overall setup. I think three things could help improve this, in my eyes:* Brighter, it''s very dark now* Tighter crop, the things on the wall are distracting* Different focus, my eyes want to focus on the stuff near to me, not the chair.', '2012-11-28 10:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
