(6921999, 1042227, 108580, '<td valign="top">What a joke! 8 x 1''s???? 11 x 3''s 22 x 4''s! Are people really that narrow minded? Did they not see the silver fish?</td>', 'What a joke! 8 x 1''s???? 11 x 3''s 22 x 4''s! Are people really that narrow minded? Did they not see the silver fish?', '2012-12-04 01:23:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6922002, 1042223, 108580, '<td valign="top">A feast for a mouse! WD on TT. Pity so many narrow minded 5 and sub 5 voters...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-12-04 01:26:29.</i></td>', 'A feast for a mouse! WD on TT. Pity so many narrow minded 5 and sub 5 voters...', '2012-12-04 01:25:58.000000', '2012-12-04 01:26:29.000000', 0),
(6922007, 1042194, 108580, '<td valign="top">You must have directed them to hold their poses and smiles for that 1 sec s/s though Robert. Indeed a marvellous lens but only in the right hands and on a tripod. If not you have some steady hands...</td>', 'You must have directed them to hold their poses and smiles for that 1 sec s/s though Robert. Indeed a marvellous lens but only in the right hands and on a tripod. If not you have some steady hands...', '2012-12-04 01:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6922011, 1042244, 108580, '<td valign="top">When one has as many ribbons as you, I guess you can question getting this one... :P<br/>As Robert remarked it evoked feelings of <strike>days</strike> years gone by for me. The highlights and blown areas are perfect when viewed in the light of a faded ''memory''. 8.</td>', 'When one has as many ribbons as you, I guess you can question getting this one... :PAs Robert remarked it evoked feelings of days years gone by for me. The highlights and blown areas are perfect when viewed in the light of a faded ''memory''. 8.', '2012-12-04 01:34:24.000000', NULL, 0),
