(6922141, 1042655, 113278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Ha! at Bear...<br/> <br/>But... where''s the FEAST?!<br/> <br/>It''s lovely, truly... but... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>We went on vacation for Thanksgiving this year so we didn''t have a traditional meal or feast, no turkey or any of that stuff so I went with the description that said <br/> <br/>"Or if you''re not celebrating Thanksgiving, simply photograph a nice meal you created."<br/> <br/>Thank you for the comment, glad you enjoyed it.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Ha! at Bear... But... where''s the FEAST?! It''s lovely, truly... but...   We went on vacation for Thanksgiving this year so we didn''t have a traditional meal or feast, no turkey or any of that stuff so I went with the description that said  "Or if you''re not celebrating Thanksgiving, simply photograph a nice meal you created." Thank you for the comment, glad you enjoyed it.', '2012-12-04 05:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6922142, 1042194, 103032, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue sir.  The Norman Rockwell feel came across as you wanted. I didn''t mention it before, the table setting is/was impressive. Nice work.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue sir.  The Norman Rockwell feel came across as you wanted. I didn''t mention it before, the table setting is/was impressive. Nice work.', '2012-12-04 05:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
