(6923410, 1042244, 75713, '<td valign="top">Indeed you did tap into some memories - days when the good dishes were taken out and used and then carefully packed away again.  But that''s not the only reason - this is a beautiful shot that is beautifully pped and doesn''t look set-up - it looks like a table awaiting a family who will laugh and share and enjoy eating off of the special dishes.  Congratulations<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=103142" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">vawendy</a> and thanks for the memories.</td>', 'Indeed you did tap into some memories - days when the good dishes were taken out and used and then carefully packed away again.  But that''s not the only reason - this is a beautiful shot that is beautifully pped and doesn''t look set-up - it looks like a table awaiting a family who will laugh and share and enjoy eating off of the special dishes.  Congratulations vawendy and thanks for the memories.', '2012-12-05 03:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
